    <DataNode elementId="AT3G01500-MONOMER" textLabel="AT3G01500-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="P27140" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="535" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The cDNA encoding a &amp;beta;-carbonic anhydrase (&amp;beta;-CA1) has been identified and partially characterized in &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;. The &amp;beta;-CA1 expression responded to elevated CO2 levels indicating the possibility for perceiving and responding to changes in environmental CO2 concentrations at the genetic level |CITS: [1463847]| |CITS: [8029363]|. The enzyme was localized to the chloroplast |CITS: [7520589]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT3G01500-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT3G01500.2" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="P27140" />
